INSTALL
=====

Requirements: node 18+ (any build with fetch). No native modules,
no build step, no npm dependencies. That is the point.

    1. node scripts/get-ruffle.mjs
       Downloads the current ruffle selfhosted web release into
       vendor/ruffle/ (MIT/Apache licensed, unmodified).

    2. node src/build.mjs yourgame.swf
       Writes yourgame.html next to the swf. One file. Copy it to a
       USB stick, email it to yourself, open it from file://.

Options:
    -o NAME.html   output name (default: <input>.html)
    --baseline     embed only the non-SIMD wasm (smaller, slower)

Tested: chrome/edge (file:// + http), firefox, ruffle nightly
2026-10-26. Safari: untested, patches welcome, the fetch shim should
just work.
